Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: libfprint-2-tod1-broadcom-installer
Source: https://github.com/elementmerc/latitude-fingerprint
Comment:
 This source package contains only the scripts and packaging that fetch and
 install the Broadcom fingerprint driver. It does NOT contain the proprietary
 driver itself. The driver is downloaded from Canonical's archive at install
 time and is covered by its own licence (Broadcom-tod), which permits use but
 not redistribution. This package therefore never ships or redistributes it.

